sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant S as Streamlit
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant R as rag.py
  participant O as Ollama
  participant D as SQLite
  U->>S: Question + Send
  S->>A: POST /ask {question, conversation_id}
  A->>D: create or reuse the conversation
  A->>R: ask_question(question)
  alt no farming keyword
    R-->>A: "off-topic" refusal, no source
  else farming question
    R->>O: embed the question
    R->>R: FAISS: 5 closest excerpts
    alt best distance > 190
      R-->>A: "no relevant information"
    else relevant excerpts
      R->>O: prompt + excerpts to llama3.2:3b
      O-->>R: answer
      R-->>A: answer + PDF names
    end
  end
  A->>D: save question, answer, sources
  A-->>S: {answer, sources, conversation_id}
  S-->>U: answer + "Sources: …"
